Privacy Policy

AI Clipboard does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data to external servers.

All data, including saved prompts, is stored locally on the user's device using the browser's storage API.

We do not use analytics, tracking, or any third-party services.

We do not sell, share, or transfer user data to anyone.

Permissions are used strictly to enable core functionality:
- Access to supported AI websites to detect and restore input
- Local storage to save prompt history

If you uninstall the extension, all stored data may be permanently deleted.

For questions, please contact via GitHub.
